# Remember to never publicly share your RELEASE keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Exception: the shared DEBUG-only keystore in keys/ IS meant to be
# committed — its password is the well-known Android default ("android"),
# it never signs a release/Play Store build, and its SHA-1/Key Hash are
# registered with Google/Facebook for social login. Committing it keeps
# that registration valid across every dev machine and CI. See keys/README.md.
!/keys/debug.keystore
